WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.835 --> 00:00:06.969
The HTML edition is a single file: open it in any browser, no install and no server.

2
00:00:07.475 --> 00:00:13.033
Choose the source: a local folder, an online site or a URL list. Here we pick a folder.

3
00:00:13.538 --> 00:00:19.192
Press Start: everything runs locally in the browser. Nothing leaves your computer.

4
00:00:19.697 --> 00:00:24.631
Filter by status and search the results, just like in the native app.

5
00:00:25.132 --> 00:00:29.250
The Export menu saves the HTML report, CSV, JSON and more.

6
00:00:29.753 --> 00:00:35.407
The Guardian section adds fixes, domains, a health map, trends and compliance.

7
00:00:36.478 --> 00:00:43.620
On an online site the browser limits external checks (CORS): use the GUI or CLI for full results.

